; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR RACE CONDITION  -  VM1: the counter, round control, scores   (loads at $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Load BOTH programs - Race-VM1.lst at $4000 and Race-VM2.lst at $5000 - then
; cold-boot. VM1 and VM2 each add 1 to a shared counter 500 times (READ it, ADD
; one, WRITE it back). Round 1 has no lock and loses updates when the scheduler
; switches VMs between a read and its write; round 2 wraps the three opcodes in
; $C7 SETMULTI 00 / 01 and gets exactly 1000. VM1 prints the scores.
;
; The counter is in VM1's memory (relative $0F00); VM1 opens it with $D0 SHAREVM
; read/write, and VM2 uses the cross-VM copies $D4 COPYVMXY / $D5 COPYXVMY. The
; ADDRESS in those copies is VM1's register (R7 counter, R8 GO, R9 DONE - VM1 sets
; them once and never reuses them); only the value register is VM2's own.
; GO ($0F02) and DONE ($0F04) words coordinate the rounds; Race-VM1.lst clears
; them in its D-lines so leftovers from an earlier run cannot start a round early.
;
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-09-26 (Craig).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/race_verify.py, V0061.33, two-VM cold boot): round 1 loses 200 of 1000 (got 800), round 2 gets exactly 1000; the loss is deterministic (opcode-count scheduler), so the Elf2K should show the same 200.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 109 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 4005 D0 12          SHAREVM on, read/write             Let VM2 reach the counter
; D 4007 11 07 0F 00    LOADXI R7 0F00                     VM2's cross-VM copies take their address from
; D 400B 11 08 0F 02    LOADXI R8 0F02                     OUR registers: R7 counter, R8 GO, R9 DONE -
; D 400F 11 09 0F 04    LOADXI R9 0F04                     set once and never touched again
; D 4013 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; D 4017 32 03 00 00    COPYMX2I R3 0000                   Nothing started yet
; D 401B 11 03 0F 00    LOADXI R3 0F00
; D 401F 32 03 00 00    COPYMX2I R3 0000                   Counter = 0
; D 4023 11 0E 0C 00    LOADXI R14 0C00
; D 4027 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4029 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; D 402D 32 03 00 01    COPYMX2I R3 0001                   GO round 1
; D 4031 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 4035 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 4039 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L1:
; D 403D 39 02 AB       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R11              READ the counter
; D 4040 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 4042 3A 02 BA       COPYXMY R11 -> M(R10)              WRITE it back
; D 4045 43 06          DECX R6
; D 4047 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 4049 A1 00 52       IFFALSEI N1
; D 404C CA 31          SEROUTI 31 '1'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 404E 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N1:
; D 4052 43 05          DECX R5
; D 4054 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 4056 A1 00 3D       IFFALSEI L1
; D 4059 11 03 0F 04    LOADXI R3 0F04
; W1:
; D 405D 39 02 34       COPYMXY M(R3) -> R4
; D 4060 86 04 00 01    TESTXI R4 0001
; D 4064 A1 00 5D       IFFALSEI W1                        Wait for VM2
; D 4067 BD 00 C7       CALL RESULT
; D 406A 11 03 0F 00    LOADXI R3 0F00
; D 406E 32 03 00 00    COPYMX2I R3 0000                   Counter = 0 again
; D 4072 11 0E 0D 15    LOADXI R14 0D15
; D 4076 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4078 11 03 0F 02    LOADXI R3 0F02
; D 407C 32 03 00 02    COPYMX2I R3 0002                   GO round 2
; D 4080 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 4084 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 4088 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L2:
; D 408C C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        Lock: no switching from here ...
; D 408E 39 02 AB       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R11              READ the counter
; D 4091 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 4093 3A 02 BA       COPYXMY R11 -> M(R10)              WRITE it back
; D 4096 C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        ... to here
; D 4098 43 06          DECX R6
; D 409A 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 409C A1 00 A5       IFFALSEI N2
; D 409F CA 31          SEROUTI 31 '1'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 40A1 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N2:
; D 40A5 43 05          DECX R5
; D 40A7 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 40A9 A1 00 8C       IFFALSEI L2
; D 40AC 11 03 0F 04    LOADXI R3 0F04
; W2:
; D 40B0 39 02 34       COPYMXY M(R3) -> R4
; D 40B3 86 04 00 02    TESTXI R4 0002
; D 40B7 A1 00 B0       IFFALSEI W2                        Wait for VM2
; D 40BA BD 00 C7       CALL RESULT
; D 40BD 11 0E 0D F0    LOADXI R14 0DF0
; D 40C1 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40C3 00             HALT                               VM1 finished
; D 40C4 F0 00 00       BREAK                              End marker
; RESULT:
; D 40C7 11 0E 0D B3    LOADXI R14 0DB3
; D 40CB C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40CD 11 04 03 E8    LOADXI R4 03E8
; D 40D1 BD 01 0C       CALL PRNUM
; D 40D4 11 0E 0D C1    LOADXI R14 0DC1
; D 40D8 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40DA 11 03 0F 00    LOADXI R3 0F00
; D 40DE 39 02 34       COPYMXY M(R3) -> R4
; D 40E1 23 00 46       COPYXY R4 -> R6                    R6 = got
; D 40E4 BD 01 0C       CALL PRNUM
; D 40E7 11 04 03 E8    LOADXI R4 03E8
; D 40EB 51 46 04       SUBXYZ R4 - R6 -> R4               R4 = lost
; D 40EE 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 40F0 A1 00 FB       IFFALSEI RLOST
; D 40F3 11 0E 0D D2    LOADXI R14 0DD2
; D 40F7 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 40F9 BE 00          RETURN
; RLOST:
; D 40FB 11 0E 0D C9    LOADXI R14 0DC9
; D 40FF C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4101 BD 01 0C       CALL PRNUM
; D 4104 11 0E 0D E4    LOADXI R14 0DE4
; D 4108 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 410A BE 00          RETURN
; PRNUM:
; D 410C 11 03 03 E8    LOADXI R3 03E8
; D 4110 4D 43          DIVXY R4 / R3
; D 4112 25             COPYMAA
; D 4113 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4116 C9             SEROUT
; D 4117 27             COPYREMA
; D 4118 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 411A 11 03 00 64    LOADXI R3 0064
; D 411E 4D 43          DIVXY R4 / R3
; D 4120 25             COPYMAA
; D 4121 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4124 C9             SEROUT
; D 4125 27             COPYREMA
; D 4126 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 4128 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 412A 25             COPYMAA
; D 412B 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 412E C9             SEROUT
; D 412F 27             COPYREMA
; D 4130 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4133 C9             SEROUT
; D 4134 BE 00          RETURN

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; CODE  -  download this block
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

